{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S08、S10、S11、S12这些短停留段落里，纵向交替的信息较密，观众容易来不及抓住全部层次；X的左右分栏更便于快速扫读。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的左右分栏让叙事和音乐感受各有位置，扫起来更直接，但右侧短词较容易变成彼此独立的印象。Y把人物心理变化与音乐中的具体感受交替呈现，【】突出关键转折，既能看懂他为什么反复动摇，也能感受到亲近、委屈、孤独和逐渐接纳之间的细微变化。尤其S06至S13，Y把反复怀念、害怕失去、重新站稳的过程交代得更充分，音乐细节也更具体，因此整体体验更完整。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fdc33639-7d14-4f65-a7cd-6912889076b0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T182902707594Z", "elapsed_seconds": 57.985, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:30:00.704011+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ab1b25f31f5405b408986447973178303e2db8c6d2353ab517eef6bbd5cfd47b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_we